deterministic red tests[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]red-tests[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]red-tests: give `ref create --audio` a completion decision (bob-cli-4j),[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm the stale `clip` help snapshot is fixed (bob-cli-5i), and make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the listen-card test accept both Pandoc ampersand escapings without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]losing URI coverage (bob-cli-4u); close all three.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop lib tests from racing on process environment[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]env-isolation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]env-isolation: replace every module-private env-mutating test helper [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with one shared isolation mechanism that never lets a test see another [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test's BOB_DAY_FILE or BOB_NOW, enforce it with clippy, stress-test it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and close bob-cli-2e, bob-cli-40 (superseded) and bob-cli-5c.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the canonical just check gate[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]check-gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after red-tests, env-isolation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]check-gate: add `just check` (fmt, clippy, and every test binary with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--no-fail-fast), make `just test` stop masking binaries, clear any [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remaining clippy deny or environment-dependent CLI test, document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, prove it green twice, and close bob-cli-3c.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repair the artifact-link event store[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]link-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]link-store: plan and run a backed-up data repair of the colliding [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation_id events in the plans sidecar so `sase artifact doctor` is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]healthy and typed links write again, backfill the relations kept as free[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text, propose the sase hardening as follow-ups, and close bob-cli-21.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the Tasks JS sandbox only when a query needs it[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tasks-sandbox[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks-sandbox: construct the Tasks JavaScript sandbox lazily and give [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its initialization its own budget apart from the 2 s per-expression [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deadline, add regression tests, measure before/after latency on the live[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read path, and close bob-cli-33.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refuse bare plugin syncs from a different bob-plugins checkout[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-sync-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-sync-guard: make `bob plugins sync` without `--repo` abort [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before any pull or copy when run from inside a bob-plugins checkout [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]other than the resolved repo, test it, document the rule in bob-cli and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-plugins AGENTS.md, and close bob-cli-59.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migrate zorg-era reading records into the reference library[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold white on #AF5FFF] xlarge [/bold white on #AF5FFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ref-migration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after check-gate[/#AF87FF